// Episode 2, level 4. Coordinates in metres, x = east, y = north, z = up.
// The city's elevated Express Line, which the hive's servants use to move between the
// waterfront and downtown. Rex rides it toward the mall.
// Route: the depot yard at street level (start west, facing east; a retired car on blocks,
// crates, concrete barriers) → the maintenance shed to the north (the shotgun by the inspection
// pit) → the substation through the gate in the yard's south wall (transformers, live puddles;
// the chaingun in the control kiosk) → the parts store (containers, racks) → the door east into
// the depot office → the dispatch nook and the Blue key (channel 1: the office's front door
// opens on the yard, the shortcut back) → the blue depot gate in the yard's east wall → the
// street under the line (a parked van, the line's pylons; Drones under the walkways) → the
// signal tower's base door → the base lift up to the relay room (z 8): the Red key in the live
// fuse bay → the red door → the cab lift up to the signal cab (z 12): the jetpack, the rocket
// launcher and the line switch (channel 4: the relay room's walkway door, platform A's boarding
// gate and the station's street shutter open) → out onto the rail beam walkways (z 8, railed,
// over the street): north to the junction deck, west to Station A → platform A: through the
// boarding gate into the car. Stepping aboard fires channel 6 (the car runs 55.8 m east along
// the glazed guideway over the street) and channel 7 (a rumble; the maintenance closet on
// platform B opens, awake) → platform B: its screen door → down the stairs to the concourse
// (cafe, electronics store, information kiosk) → the security office: its switch (channel 8)
// slides the mall shutter up into its pocket and opens the skybridge closet, awake → the
// skybridge → the exit switch at the mall doors.
// The ticket hall (vending machine, payphone, turnstiles) hangs off platform A by its stairs;
// its street entrance is shuttered until channel 4, the shortcut back down to the street.
// The guideway's floor is a live rail; a call button on platform A (channel 6) brings the car
// back, and stepping aboard again sends it off.
// Secrets: (1) a crouch vent low in the ticket hall's west wall (1.2 m) into the old
// signalling room (armour, pipe bombs); (2) the parts store's west wall cracks open on a blast
// (a barrel beside it): a stash with an atom and rockets; (3) the signal gantry on its pylon
// east of the junction deck at z 11.5, jetpack only (atom, rockets). Validate warns that the
// stash's and the gantry's items "cannot be reached from the start": a crack-wall stash and a
// jetpack ledge, by design.
// Built by `rr-tools build` from levels/src/express_line.ron. Do not edit; edit the source and rebuild.
